<?php
$help=[
'Getting started'=>['Sign in using the Owner account provisioned by the protected CLI installer. The dashboard shows the current month by default. The blue banner identifies a workspace containing sample data.','Open Business profile to enter your details. Review the demo invoices and payments before adding real records.'],
'Dashboard & analytics'=>['Select a reporting period in Business overview. Revenue means the net total of issued invoices; cash received means recorded payments after reversals. They are different metrics.','Outstanding balances refer to invoices issued within the selected period, with all currently applied payments deducted. No profit figure is claimed. Click a chart segment to open the corresponding invoice status.'],
'Customers'=>['Open Customers → Add customer. A name is required; other fields are optional. Click a customer name to open their details and permitted invoices.','Archive keeps historical relationships. Records with financial history are never silently deleted. Export requires its own permission.'],
'Leads & sales'=>['Add a contact, deal value, stage, expected close date, and follow-up. Pipeline view groups active opportunities by stage. Edit a lead to change its stage.','Convert creates a customer or detects an existing matching email. If a match is reported, enter the existing customer ID and convert again to link it explicitly.'],
'Products & services'=>['Add a name, selling price, description, category and unit. Product defaults populate invoice line descriptions, rates and tax.','Inventory and warehouse tracking are outside this release. Archive inactive catalog entries to preserve old invoices.'],
'Tasks & reminders'=>['Add a title, due date, priority and optional related customer/Manager. Pending tasks appear on the dashboard, with an overdue indicator where relevant.','Use the task checkbox to complete a task, or edit its status. Email, SMS and WhatsApp reminders require a separate delivery integration.'],
'Quotations'=>['Create a quotation, select its customer and add line items. Save it as a draft, review and issue it. Mark a sent quotation accepted when the customer agrees.','Convert an accepted quotation into a new invoice draft. The original quotation remains unchanged and can be converted only once.'],
'Customer bills & invoices'=>['Create invoice → choose an active customer → add items → Save draft. The estimated total is only a preview; the server independently recalculates quantities, discounts and taxes.','Review the document and issue it. Issuance preserves business and customer details. Download PDF or print with the corresponding permission. Standard invoices are implemented; GST-specific statutory templates are not ready.'],
'Payments'=>['Open an issued invoice and enter a payment amount, date, method and optional reference. Partial payments are supported. A receipt cannot exceed the outstanding balance.','Repeated submission of the same payment form does not create a second receipt. Corrections require a reversal with a reason. Reverse all payments before voiding an invoice. This records receipts and does not charge a payment gateway.'],
'Expenses'=>['Add the date, category, description, amount and payment method. Active expenses feed the dashboard and reports.','Archive incorrect entries with an audit trail. This module is an expense register, not a double-entry accounting system.'],
'Reports & exports'=>['Open Reports and choose Revenue, Invoices, Payments, Outstanding, Aging, Expenses, Customers, Products, Leads, Quotations, Manager activity or Business summary. Select the date period.','Export CSV requires export permission. CSV values are protected against spreadsheet formula injection. Printed reports show their reporting period.'],
'Manager permissions'=>['Only the Owner can create and deactivate Managers or change their permissions. Open Managers → Add manager and select access for each operation.','View, create, issue, void, record, reverse and export are distinct permissions. Deactivation revokes access on the next request. Demo Managers begin inactive with an unknown random password; set a new password before activating them.'],
'AI Assistant & provider setup'=>['The Owner must configure a provider and explicitly enable AI under AI & integrations. Supported adapters are OpenAI-compatible chat completions, Anthropic messages and Gemini generateContent. Enter a full public HTTPS endpoint and a model ID supported by your provider.','Enter the API key once; it is encrypted on the server and never sent to browser JavaScript. Test the provider before enabling AI. Provider fees and data policies are set by that provider. Only selected authorized data is sent, with an hourly request cap. Use the remove-credentials action to rotate or remove keys.'],
'AI approvals & security'=>['The assistant receives data only from a fixed selection of backend read tools. It cannot run SQL or directly modify business records. Financial tools require financial AI access and the underlying module permissions.','Task proposals are the initial supported action. The Owner reviews the exact title, date and description and explicitly approves or rejects. Proposals expire after 30 minutes and cannot be replayed. Other mutation types are not implemented.'],
'AI memory & prompts'=>['Conversation history is private to the creating user and business. Turn off history to prevent saving new messages. Clear a conversation from the chat or clear business history in Settings.','Long-term automatic memory is disabled. Business instructions supplement fixed safety rules and are versioned; they cannot grant access or approve an operation.'],
'Themes & customization'=>['Choose Light, Dark or System and a Default, Compact or Large density preset in Appearance. Preview the change and save it to your account.','The topbar theme button provides a device preference. Restore defaults in Appearance and save to return to the default design. Advanced palette and widget customization is still pending.'],
'Backup & restore'=>['Create an operational database backup in Backup & restore. It contains CRM, invoices and line items, payments, expenses, settings and the business profile. Provider keys, accounts, conversations, and application configuration are excluded. Store the private application key separately.','Download and keep a copy in a secure location. To restore, enter your Owner password and upload a signed JSON backup from this installation. Review the table replacement preview, enter your password again and type RESTORE. A recovery backup is created before restoration and financial relationships are checked before commit.'],
'Demo data & reset'=>['Open Demo data & reset to see counts of explicitly marked demo records. Enter your Owner password and type REMOVE DEMO to remove them after a recovery backup is created.','The operation preserves your Owner account and non-demo records. Removal is blocked when real records rely on demo data. Samples never reappear automatically. Full destructive resets are not available.'],
'Local installation & troubleshooting'=>['Use a currently supported PHP version, MariaDB/MySQL, Composer and Apache or the PHP development server. Follow docs/installation.md. Point the web server only at ybt/public; keep configuration and storage outside public access.','If sign-in fails repeatedly, wait 15 minutes before retrying. If a form expires, reload it. Check the private application log for server errors. For a provider error, check endpoint, model availability, key and account billing.'],
'Security & release readiness'=>['Use HTTPS, unique strong passwords, a least-privilege database user, private storage and regular tested backups. Keep PHP and Composer dependencies updated.','This is a development preview. See docs/acceptance.md for remaining requirements and release gates. Do not treat it as production-ready until the full PRD test and deployment checklist is satisfied.'],
];foreach($help as $title=>$paragraphs):?><section class="help-section" data-help-section><h3><?= e($title) ?></h3><?php foreach($paragraphs as $paragraph): ?><p><?= e($paragraph) ?></p><?php endforeach; ?></section><?php endforeach; ?>
